{"generated": "2026-08-14 20:51", "brief": "<b>1. 글로벌 AI 및 로봇 기업의 IPO 추진</b>\n앤트로픽(Anthropic)이 오는 10월 나스닥 상장을 목표로 약 600억 달러 규모의 IPO를 계획하고 있으며, 오픈AI(OpenAI) 역시 연간 환산 매출 400억 달러를 돌파하며 IPO 계획을 구체화하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE1BaklIVC1tZEo5WUE5ejgyaFBsVUhvRG5HMkpMZkdFMDBxc0g3NWRlMzBWSjc1czFXU2dIb1dkRmtmR1dzTzBEQVZrNHp3amkyendLcnVEbDNDVnEyZzFWcDU4RlcyMFZxX1ZZ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#36</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOVEpsNHFHM2pZbEJEcDJ5ank2aGJaVXB4ZC1HeVBYeF9ZcXNDTVJHNk5aaDJkaWRsblRaZHBSdXZzbzNEc01ZdmhuNDlsZkhHU1AzVGtmTERZcFNaVmpjVExzVmpJRzcwSE80b053dlppQW9mNlJrZ1FSMXBYbjRNVQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#37</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNU1NCcHphTm5JRmV2VHRnUk43VnVLSEJaTno4cHlNWkU5QVM1UTJjRzdPX1lfZkE0OTllMDdPMzRMX2M4T3NGTVM1WUVVN3BYZ3R1d0NXcDRrUWpHOUw1NG5JZkppc2dvS2EzWGl6MDdETWxxMWFHR2VtTDVfY0YwaUdaSlhjWnFlNWVTQkZWdkpOSnJ1SzQ1RTRsQjA4andXWm15NU9XVWJ4dVE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#38</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE1vR21vVWR6RnFZZGQ2dFEwSm9FUjE2cW9IUk0tN1dXTVFQanBUbTlMM0h1N1Q2OWlMT19kMXJVNEV6ME9ZSXVpZUdFZjhqMFVuaDR2NEJtMUstd2U0THQ3QlBsWURIdG1va0NWY0RObw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#39</a>]. 한편 휴머노이드 로봇 기업 유니트리(Unitree)의 IPO는 투자자들이 대거 몰리며 5,000배가 넘는 청약 경쟁률을 기록했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#40</a>].\n\n<b>2. SK그룹과 빌 게이츠의 SMR 동맹 및 에너지·로봇 투자</b>\n최태원 SK그룹 회장과 빌 게이츠 테라파워 창립자가 회동을 가진 가운데, SK가 나트륨 기반 소형모듈원전(SMR) 사업개발 파트너로 부상하며 전력 풀스텍 구축을 목표로 하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOaWVNODlWTXNzMW9yNEM3WkR6VlpXQnRyRWdlUFJ5ZF85Vmw2aGQ5dmtkeXRtcmdKT3ZnSXVCZUY2S3B2NUhzUDgtdkt6U1RIbGw1ajNmVWVaM3ROUUd4eGtmeVlMUXExZTdPdmtRSTlGOHJyUkJCSlR3LVpDY0EtUVZER25CRkw0NmdR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#1</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQYjR6ZERVOVVsVjVSX3BERkFHTzRZZ2